ailypharm.com)\n기자의\n다른기사 보기\n\n 노보노디스크 상반기 매출 26조원…비만치료제 효과 2024-08-08 12:07:44\n 비만넘어 뇌질환까지…국내제약 \"GLP-1 적응증 확대 도전\" 2024-07-10 13:11:50\n GLP-1 활용도↑...당뇨병·비만 이어 MASH까지 타깃 2024-06-12 05:59:00\n\n New\n    \n  약사님 전용 알림 채널, 지금 바로 추가!  \n  데일리팜 카톡 (클릭)  \n  ~12.31 까지\n\n  New\n    \n  OTC 최신 트렌드,  \n   다시 보고 배우는  \n  TV팜도라 (클릭)  \n  ~12.31 까지\n New\n    \n  매일 혜택이 쏟아지는 약사 전용 공간  \n  팜스타클럽 (클릭)  \n  ~12.31 까지\n\n  New\n    \n  약사들의 이야기가 피어나는 커뮤니티  \n  약담소 (클릭)  \n  ~12.31 까지\n\n독자의견\n\n0\n\n익명의견 쓰기 | \n실명의견쓰기 \n운영규칙\n\n닫기", "raw_content": "25.08.12 (화) 20:51\n\n# \n\n* [로그인](https://www.dailypharm.com/Users/login/login.html)\n* [회원가입](https://www.dailypharm.com/Users/login/join.html)\n* [광고문의](//www.dailypharm.com/Users/Company/Marketing_Inquire.html)\n* [독자제보](//www.dailypharm.com/Users/Company/Report_Article.html)\n* [Event](//www.dailypharm.com/Users/Event/EventList.html)\n\n\n\n\n* [뉴스](#)\n  + [전체기사](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/NewsList.html)\n  + [정책 · 법률](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/SectionList.html?Section=1)\n  + [제약 · 바이오](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/SectionList.html?Section=2)\n  + [약국 · 병원](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/SectionList.html?Section=3)\n  + [카드뉴스](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/NewsList.html?mode=nPlan&nPlanID=20)\n* [팜TV](https://tv.dailypharm.com/)\n  + [이슈영상](https://tv.dailypharm.com/List.html?SectionID=32)\n  + [DP초대석](https://tv.dailypharm.com/List.html?SectionID=99)\n  + [이슈진단](https://tv.dailypharm.com/List.html?SectionID=82)\n  + [알아보잡](https://tv.dailypharm.com/List.html?SectionID=100)\n* [오피니언](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/Opinion.html)\n  + [전문가칼럼](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/NewsList.html?mode=SubSectionList&Section=4&SubSection=16)\n  + [데스크시선](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/NewsList.html?mode=SubSectionList&Section=4&SubSection=18)\n  + [기자수첩](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/NewsList.html?mode=SubSectionList&Section=4&SubSection=20)\n  + [특별기고](//www.dailypharm.com/Users//News/NewsList.html?mode=S